3. When I was trying to load for 10 symbols at a time then loading to mysql use to pause indefinitely, So I checked
whether I am doing too many connections to MySQL, added prints to see exactly where it is stopping, then I tried
fixing concurrency issue by adding thread but still same issue was happening but then I found out that using "as new row"
in the "overview" script was making it pause because it was a known bug "pymysql protocol freeze on AS new_row syntax". So
I switched the script to previous version i.e. I used "insert into values"



